              "04bb0a14c4b33482f79b40b97df65008a828b38c"
            ],
            "confidence": "high"
          },
          {
            "text": "Shipped a new server handler that scans up to 50 recent sessions with per-session (4s) and overall (12s) deadlines, capped query length, and bounded plain-text snippets — and reports scanned vs. skipped counts so partial searches are never presented as complete.",
            "commit_shas": [
              "04bb0a14c4b33482f79b40b97df65008a828b38c"
